# Final Recommendation

## Master These First

### Tier 1
- Problem Statement
- Architecture
- End-to-End Pipeline
- Tech Stack
- Dataset
- Model Selection
- Training
- Inference
- Evaluation
- Challenges
- Limitations
- Future Improvements

### Tier 2
- Prompt Engineering
- RAG
- Embeddings
- Vector Databases
- Chunking
- Retrieval
- LangGraph
- State Management
- Structured Outputs
- Provider Pattern
- Error Handling

### Tier 3
- Deployment
- Scalability
- Security
- Performance
- Logging
- Testing
- API Design

For **AI/ML fresher interviews**, interviewers spend a significant portion of the discussion on your projects. You should be able to explain each project **without looking at the code**, justify every design decision, discuss trade-offs, identify limitations, and propose future improvements.
